Dbody 5x 20 DBODY
.MODEL DBODY D(IS=7.78E-9 N=1.946325 RS=0.023193 TT=15.97n)
Ra 4 2 7.8E-1
Rs 5x 5 0.5m
Ls 5 30 0.5n
