E2 8 6 4 1 2
.MODEL INTER NMOS(VTO=0 KP=10 LEVEL=1)
Cgdmax 7 4 54p
Rcgd 7 4 10meg
Dgd 6 4 DGD
Rdgd 4 6 10meg
.MODEL DGD D(M=2.71E-1 VJ=1.44E-5 CJO=54p)
M3 7 9 1 1 INTER
E3 9 1 4 1 -2
*ZX SECTION
EOUT 4x 6x poly(2) (1x,0) (3x,0) 0 0 0 0 1
FCOPY 0 3x VSENSE 1
RIN 1x 0 1G
VSENSE 6x 5x 0
