Dbody 5x 20 DBODY
.MODEL DBODY D(IS=7.61E-17 N=0.671205 RS=.001633 TT=5.75n)
Ra 4 2 1.1E-2
Rs 5x 5 0.5m
Ls 5 30 0.5n
M2 1 8 6 6 INTER
E2 8 6 4 1 2
.MODEL INTER NMOS(VTO=0 KP=10 LEVEL=1)
Cgdmax 7 4 270p
Rcgd 7 4 10meg
Dgd 6 4 DGD
Rdgd 6 4 10meg
.MODEL DGD D(M=2.89E-1 VJ=1.28E-2 CJO=270p)
M3 7 9 1 1 INTER
E3 9 1 4 1 -2
