+THETA=.06667 VMAX=3E5 LEVEL=3)
Cgs 1 5x 500p
Rd 20 4 2.4E-2
Dds 5x 4 DDS
.MODEL DDS D(M=6.5E-1 VJ=1.7 CJO=158p)
Dbody 5x 20 DBODY
.MODEL DBODY D(IS=4.52E-13 N=1.017211 RS=.00064 TT=34.35n)
Ra 4 2 2.4E-2
Rs 5x 5 0.5m
Ls 5 30 0.5n
M2 1 8 6 6 INTER
E2 8 6 4 1 2
.MODEL INTER NMOS(VTO=0 KP=10 LEVEL=1)
Cgdmax 7 4 735p
Rcgd 7 4 10meg
Dgd 6 4 DGD
Rdgd 6 4 10meg
.MODEL DGD D(M=3.01E-1 VJ=4.27E-4 CJO=735p)
M3 7 9 1 1 INTER
E3 9 1 4 1 -2
*ZX SECTION
EOUT 4x 6x poly(2) (1x,0) (3x,0) 0 0 0 0 1
FCOPY 0 3x VSENSE 1
RIN 1x 0 1G
VSENSE 6x 5x 0
RREF 3x 0 10m
*TEMP SECTION
ED 101 0 VALUE {V(50,100)}
VAMB 100 0 25
EKP 1x 0 101 0 .04
*VTO TEMP SECTION
EVTO 102 0 101 0 .006
EVT 12x 11x 102 0 1
