E1 2 0 4 0 1
Ro 2 7 10
Vlow 3 0 DC={VLOW}
Vhigh 8 0 DC={VHIGH}
Dlow 3 4 DCLP
Dhigh 4 8 DCLP
.MODEL DCLP D N=0.01
