* UVLO
* Active low
X_U1         			VPORTP UVLO_INT ARTN UVLO_SPICE PARAMS: VON=38V VOFF=32V TD=90us
X_U2         			VUVLO UVLO_EXT ARTN 	UVLO_SPICE PARAMS: VON=1.2V VOFF=1V TD=90us
