*
.SUBCKT COMPAR NINV INV OUT params: VHIGH=12 VLOW=100m
EB1 4 0 Value = { IF ( V(NINV,INV) > 0, {VHIGH}, {VLOW} ) }
RO 4 OUT 100
CO OUT 0 10P
.ENDS
*
.SUBCKT LIMIT 1 2 PARAMS: K=1 PLIM=7.5 NLIM=4.25
*PARAMETERS ARE GAIN={K}
*POS LIMIT = {PLIM}  NEG LIMIT = {NLIM}
RIN 1 0 1E12
E1 3 0 VALUE = { V(0,1)*K}
RC1 2 4 1MEG
C1 2 4 1F IC=0
R1 3 4 1MEG
E2 2 0 0 4 1E6
*DIODES WILL HAVE .0597V DROP AT 10V INPUT FOR GAIN=1
*IDIODE = IS*EXP(.597/.O26)
