.MODEL DDS D(M=2.94E-1 VJ=3.06E-2 CJO=478p)
Dbody 5x 20 DBODY
.MODEL DBODY D(IS=2.7E-13 N=1.029547 RS=.001172 TT=16.875n)
Ra 4 2 1.75E-2
Rs 5x 5 0.5m
Ls 5 30 0.5n
M2 1 8 6 6 INTER
E2 8 6 4 1 2
.MODEL INTER NMOS(VTO=0 KP=10 LEVEL=1)
Cgdmax 7 4 610p
Rcgd 7 4 10meg
