Rdgd 6 4 10meg
.MODEL DGD D(M=6.9E-1 VJ=8.24E-1 CJO=610p)
M3 7 9 1 1 INTER
E3 9 1 4 1 -2
*ZX SECTION
EOUT 4x 6x poly(2) (1x,0) (3x,0) 0 0 0 0 1
FCOPY 0 3x VSENSE 1
RIN 1x 0 1G
VSENSE 6x 5x 0
RREF 3x 0 10m
