******REV 1.1 Modifications*******
* 1) Reduced Vref ($N_0018) from 2.54V to 2.5V
* 2) Reduced VOVP threshold from 1.08*Vref to 1.06*Vref
* 3) Removed internal capacitor from ZCD pin to ground
***********************************
