GIap a p Value = { (V(dc)/(V(dc)+V(d2)))*I(VM) }
Ed2 d2X 0 value = { (2*{L}*{Fs}*I(VM)/(V(dc)*V(a,c)+1u)) - V(dc) }
Xd2 d2X dc d2 limit2
RS 7 c 1u
VM 6 7
*
.ENDS
********
.SUBCKT PWMVM a c p d params: L=75u Fs=100k
